WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Everforest: the Nook drops from the notch with Catacombs by Fog Lake, a countdown and the weather.

00:02.400 --> 00:04.900
The dock opens the Music page.

00:04.900 --> 00:07.300
KemoSabe: a month calendar with year progress, reminders and a focus timer.

00:07.300 --> 00:09.600
The Calendar page shows today beside the month.

00:09.600 --> 00:12.000
MacSpaces theme: the forecast, notes, clipboard and Keep Awake.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.500
The Weather page shows the next hours and days.
